15	10	1.0

query IIR
SELECT * FROM pgr_dijkstraCostMatrix((SELECT * FROM edges), [5, 6, 10, 15, 2], false);
----
5	6	1.0
5	10	2.0
5	15	3.0
6	5	1.0
